@startuml

title Registry packages
caption All packages and their dependencies are [[https://www.archunit.org/{What is ArchUnit?} ArchUnit]]-tested against the code
footer docs/architecture/versions-registry-packages.puml

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam hyperlinkColor #1A4FA0
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 20
' the box label is the package pattern itself, which ArchUnit reads from the stereotype;
' the stereotype is hidden so the pattern is not printed twice
hide stereotype
skinparam ranksep 30
<style>
component {
  BackGroundColor #ECEFF1
  LineColor #546E7A
}
arrow {
  LineColor #78909C
}
</style>

' A box is a package directly under versions.registry and its subpackages (<<..porthole.versions.registry.x..>>); [..registry] is the
' slice's root package alone. An arrow is a dependency the code has: PackagesArchTest fails on one the code has and
' this file does not draw, and on one drawn here that the code lacks. Dependencies on other slices and on shared are
' not drawn; the C3 view has those. These are not a slice's adapters, so ArchitectureTest's root-and-adapters rule
' does not cover them, and nothing forbids cycles inside a slice.

[..registry.distribution] <<..porthole.versions.registry.distribution..>>
[..registry.dockerhub] <<..porthole.versions.registry.dockerhub..>>
[..registry.ghcr] <<..porthole.versions.registry.ghcr..>>
[..registry] <<..porthole.versions.registry>>

[..registry.dockerhub] --> [..registry.distribution]
[..registry.ghcr] --> [..registry.distribution]

' Three cycles, each drawn as one red line with a head at each end, which ArchUnit cannot read, backed by two hidden
' arrows, which it reads as the two dependencies:
' - root and distribution: DistributionClient uses TagPagination, TagPage and RegistryRequests from the root, which
'   throw and catch distribution's RegistryProtocolException.
' - root and each provider: the providers implement the root's RegistryClient and use its pagination and requests,
'   and the root's RegistryConfiguration constructs them.
[..registry] <-[#C62828]-> [..registry.distribution]
[..registry] -[hidden]-> [..registry.distribution]
[..registry.distribution] -[hidden]-> [..registry]
[..registry] <-[#C62828]-> [..registry.dockerhub]
[..registry] -[hidden]-> [..registry.dockerhub]
[..registry.dockerhub] -[hidden]-> [..registry]
[..registry] <-[#C62828]-> [..registry.ghcr]
[..registry] -[hidden]-> [..registry.ghcr]
[..registry.ghcr] -[hidden]-> [..registry]

@enduml
